{"detail": {"templateUuid": "503738ec85ae4828bb0cc36360f5e5b5", "projectUuid": "f5f7449497f5448e9b9198893f8a69f5", "name": "【寻找王伟】--你手机里是不是也躺着一个一直舍不得删的电话号码？", "description": "故事跨越 30 年，從 1995 走到 2025。\n那是通信技術更迭最快的時代。\n小明找了王偉 30 年。\n畢業那年，兩個換了新手機號的人奔赴遠方。\n時代的列車飛速駛過，他們沒有再相遇。\n——\n他以為那些拼命想找到的人，不知不覺已被留在了回憶裡。\n代價是：三十年的執著尋找，只換來一聲嘆息。\n直到那天，他的手表彈出一條“來自手機通訊錄”的好友申請。\n那個早就注銷的空號，在她的手機裡靜靜躺了 18 年。他笑了。\n——\n謹以《尋找王偉》\n虛構的故事\n獻給現實中所有還在心底留著一個號碼的人。\n世界很大， 總有一個人，在你看不到的地方，悄悄記了你，很多年。", "coverUrl": "/assets/0733513aa3b6d7b0.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/d20421bb9cac40fb99763d309111430a/19505f9cdb2e3de0f4bec6e6177b6d2af305d2cc.mp4", "snapshotId": 24321, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 3462983, "ownerUuid": "d20421bb9cac40fb99763d309111430a", "avatar": "/assets/60489f75b1a0bf42.webp", "nickname": "大大大大大", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 182, "tags": [{"id": 1104, "code": "creative_tvc", "tagLabel": "创意TVC", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1104/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3042, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-故事短片", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3042", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "soci